The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository.

The files under `nms_sorter/data/` are a derived index of data that ships with
No Man's Sky. Hello Games owns the underlying data. The generator that builds
the index is shipped in `tools/`, so anyone can rebuild it from their own game
install. See `docs/DATA.md` for provenance, the exact build it was built from,
and the rebuild steps.

